# RBAC permissions doc

When you add or change a feature, or any action under a feature:

1. Update `docs/[11] RBAC/[02] permission-definitions.md` with the matching permission(s).
2. Add the same key(s) to `lib/constants/permissions.ts` (`PERMISSIONS` + `PERMISSION_DEFINITIONS`).
